intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tends to be short-term gain, ending in the same pain," he adds. USD/JPY is down 0.6% at 121.67. (ronnie.harui@wsj.com)\par \par \uc2 0528 GMT - \uc2 Westpac\uc2  turns more hawkish about the trajectory of \uc2 RBA\uc2  raising its official cash rate. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  starts to increase rates in August this year, \uc2 Westpac\uc2  now expects that by December 2022 the \uc2 RBA\uc2  would have restored the 65 basis points of emergency cuts which it implemented during Covid-19. \uc2 Westpac\uc2  had earlier projected that this would not happen until February 2023. Even though the \uc2 RBA\uc2  is set to run policy according to Australia's economic conditions rather than following the U.S. Fed, the more aggressive actions of the Fed are likely to slightly accelerate the \uc2 RBA\uc2  's tightening profile, \uc2 Westpac\uc2  says. (james.glynn@wsj.com; @JamesGlynnWSJ)\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 25, 2022 02:28 ET (06:28 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020220325ei3p000fg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
