\par\par \b \uc2 *BOJ Gov Kuroda: Will Act Properly Without Hesitation if Needed\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par 06:32\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2020, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 9 Mar 2020 01:33 ET *BOJ Gov Kuroda: Markets Remain Nervous; Will Continue to Monitor Carefully\par \par \uc2 9 Mar 2020 01:35 ET *BOJ's Kuroda: Will Make Utmost Efforts Given Unclear Economic Outlook, Unstable Markets\par \par \uc2 9 Mar 2020 01:38 ET *\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fin Min Aso: No Comment on Whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Will \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market\par \par \uc2 9 Mar 2020 02:10 ET  BOJ Ready to Take Additional Easing Action if Needed, Gov Kuroda Says\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Megumi Fujikawa \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO--Bank of Japan Gov. Haruhiko Kuroda reiterated Monday that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stands ready to take additional easing action, as fears over the spreading virus sent the yen sharply higher and caused stocks to plunge.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The bank will especially keep careful watch on movements in the financial markets at home and abroad," Mr. Kuroda said in parliament. "We will act properly without any hesitation if needed," he added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Earlier in the day, the dollar broke below Y102 for the first time in more than three years amid growing fears over the global virus epidemic. The Nikkei Stock Average also fell below the 20000 threshold for the first time since January 2019.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Finance Minister \f28 \uc2 \f2 Taro Aso\f28 \uc2 \f2 , who attended the same parliamentary committee meeting, declined to comment on the possibility of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the ministry.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Megumi Fujikawa at megumi.fujikawa@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 March 09, 2020 02:10 ET (06:10 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020200309eg39000ep\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
